&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afue6M5UtqADpgx6kFkmxaSkT_XgIpvSprfAoKy20T8k1A&oe=699EDA4D"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 4.png", "id": "25299459349722807", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_25299459369722805_1875565800982623569_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XPYx8FOgvk4Q7kNvwHMAjU1&_nc_oc=Adlr7CIt5EsVlq2NVKU7M4n8GbRaggJie3QKJU1mPBrihq2jjaZkbrSKTKx7mPiBH5c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu383dUbr09mB01GZ7LHVlvjwBB0YEwqvhp7VstHcvWrg&oe=699EE6CF"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 5.png", "id": "2038404890292862", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2038404893626195_50283950361106217_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8B8p41FOonMQ7kNvwGuQA8S&_nc_oc=Adm9T9w036xOTGDHc-7-TZpRIEUs_GLK-3bxg9JQCxsN1Xf0ERSTOGb2o4dkco1zI1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu7VNzct7Wgv0qwjjPJBTG0UwFiNHW0U9CBkWpgtZLq6Q&oe=699EDEB7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer poster.png", "id": "1340193764070608", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1340193767403941_2787865297931591383_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Elm8t6U0KQAQ7kNvwF3XmM-&_nc_oc=AdkgNziRTgzrE8g7E3Zv1KlBmniAole1BA9kBkN2MECGX7hyP94yxDlkXbosGwjgf9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuNkJ051TzFY9fbH8HDkK1au_lzkcvz_VcCHSbNeYjcvw&oe=699EF598"}, "display_name": "Plank n' Kitty", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## Plank n' Kitty\n\nGran\u2019s cat has wandered off and ended up at the end of a plank high above the city!\n\nStep through the doorway into a virtual cartoon world, walk the plank, rescue the kitty, and bring it safely back to gran.\n\n**Plank \u2019n Kitty is a mixed-reality experience, not a game.**  \nIt\u2019s designed to be fun, approachable, and best enjoyed with friends or family taking turns.  \nEveryone can join in by watching the action on TV or mobile.\n\n---\n\n## What makes it different\n\n- **Two-way mixed-reality portal**  \n  A door in your room opens into a virtual world \u2014 and from the plank, the door becomes a portal back into your real room.\n\n- **Exciting but not extreme**  \n  High enough to feel thrilling, without pushing into fear-only territory. Accessible fun for everybody.\n\n- **Configurable play space**  \n  Preview and adjust the size and position to fit your room before you start.\n\n- **Perfect for group play**  \n  Take turns, watch reactions, and enjoy it together.\n\n- **TV casting support**  \n  Cast to a TV so everyone can see what the player sees.\n\n---\n\n## Device Support\nSupports mixed reality on Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.  \nPassthrough quality varies by device.\n\n---\n\n## Comfort Note\nThis experience involves real-world movement.  \nThis is a **room-scale mixed reality experience** and adapts to your available space.  \nMake sure your area is clear before playing.", "short_description": "Gran\u2019s cat has gone missing. Step through the portal, walk the plank high above the city, and bring the kitty home. A fun, approachable mixed-reality experience made for friends, families, and party play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rayamedia.com/home/plank-n-kitty-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rayamedia", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rayamedia.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "support